{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"Y\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"平\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\",\n    \"load\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big、small：Y的大块保留了人物处境、原因和体验之间的关系，单看大字也能顺着读懂；小字又把音乐提示和观众体验分开，补充更有针对性。X的大字虽然提炼得准确，但只看强调词，有些因果和转折需要自行补全。core：两版都完整呈现了不愿再受委屈与怀念旧日亲近之间的反复拉扯，结尾也都落在不放弃尊严、带着想念继续生活上，难分高下。concise：X略好，Y在S03、S13等处多次用感受重述刚刚出现的高兴、心热和有劲头，部分补充没有带来足够新信息。human：X略自然，Y的“他再心动”搭配不够顺，“心脏以最高负荷剧烈跳动”有明显技术腔；X的叙述衔接更符合日常表达。fine：Y更好，像伸手只摸到空处、整理衣服抬起头、后颈一凉、连呼吸都放轻等，具体落在观众的身体和心理体验上；X有较多直接描述和弦、琶音、旋律的文字。load：X更好，强调词大多是短而自然的意群，扫读负担较轻；Y在S11、S12等短停留屏幕上放入多个较长的大块，S13也有五块大字累积，整体需要更多时间才能扫完。综合来看，Y在大字理解、辅助信息和感受呈现上的优势更重要，因此选Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a30acadf-0b66-48d5-a845-02ec84bcbe00", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T040413521325Z", "elapsed_seconds": 248.891, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T04:08:22.419072+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d160ba85085cb85d96e7f8a882ed5f643eca9e39e72a0ba10227bbaffd356308", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachm